guide_text_season_tower_dungeon_1.cn:
每个关卡有3个难度(普通、困难、残酷)。
通关普通难度可达成<@gd.key>1星评级</>;
通关困难难度可达成<@gd.key>2星评级</>;
通关残酷难度可达成<@gd.key>3星评级</>;

guide_text_season_tower_dungeon_1.en:
Every stage has 3 difficulty tiers: 
Normal (rewards <@gd.key>1★</> when completed);
Hard (rewards <@gd.key>2★</> when completed);
Brutal (rewards <@gd.key>3★</> when completed).
